=+inf              outA=(-1.2018e30, 3.094e-38)\niA=3: rc=8.246211          outA=(1, 2)            <- happens to alias verts[0]\niA=4: rc=+inf              outA=(-1.1964e30, 3.094e-38)\niA=5: rc=+inf              outA=(-1.2064e30, 3.094e-38)\niA=6: rc=8.246211          outA=(1, 2)\niA=7: rc=+inf              outA=(-1.2064e30, 3.094e-38)\n```\n\n— recognisable stack residue (leaked pointer fragments), differing between\nindices that denote the same logically-absent vertex. Matching that is neither\npossible nor meaningful, so E17/E18 are excluded on the same grounds as E16/E19.\n\n## Coverage\n\nEvery non-excluded row (E1–E15, E20–E41, E43–E74 — **69 rows**) has a passing\ndifferential test in `tests/phase_c_errors.rs`. See the checklist at the bottom\nof that file's module docs, and `VERIFICATION.md` for the roll-up.\n\"\"\"\np.write_text(\"\\n\".join(head) + \"\\n\" + new)\nprint(\"done\")\nPY\nsed -n '108,150p' translation/ERRORS.md","description":"Rewrite excluded-rows section of ERRORS.md"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":621,"cache_read_input_tokens":171002,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":621,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52e2a50b-da79-4c25-983e-9e31bbba2fc9","uuid":"25c975fb-4140-495f-98ca-abda9c30c613","timestamp":"2026-08-27T07:02:55.994Z"}
